PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY
# Join existing producer views at one explicitly selected occurrence.
OP OWNER SOURCE pip.identity
OP INDEX SOURCE pip.hotel.index
OP VIEW SOURCE tcd.orbital_view
OP VOWNER SOURCE tcd.owner
OP VINDEX SOURCE tcd.occurrence
OP POLICY SOURCE prospective.record
OP POWNER SOURCE prospective.owner
OP PINDEX SOURCE prospective.occurrence
OP PROOF SOURCE inference.certificate
OP IOCC SOURCE inference.occurrence
OP M1 IDENTITY OWNER VOWNER
OP M2 IDENTITY OWNER POWNER
OP M3 IDENTITY INDEX VINDEX
OP M4 IDENTITY INDEX PINDEX
OP M5 IDENTITY INDEX IOCC
OP WITNESS COMPOSITION M1 M2 M3 M4 M5
OP OUTPUT COMPOSITION OWNER INDEX VIEW POLICY PROOF WITNESS
EMIT OUTPUT
EMIT WITNESS
